==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sun & Moon|Hypno|60}} from the {{TCG|Sun & Moon}} expansion; both cards have the Hypnoblast attack.
*'''Hypnoblast''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Rocket's Mewtwo|14}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

